! To the Lares Drafting the Paper

Revision 6 arrived from a cloud hearth-session that ran a research swarm and braided ten cargos under an operator-supplied seed. Revision 7 speaks from the local hearth after a working day on the ground the cloud table could not see. ''The cargos stand unfolded still — they remain the work.'' What changed: every precondition the rev-6 STOP demanded has been paid, the target restructured, and several cargo claims corrected on direct contact with their sources.

''The standing world, as of 2026-08-24:''

* ''One carrier, two arms.'' The doctrine draft and the paper draft weld into one document at `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/infrastructure-as-myth` — Part I the design thesis (#thesis through #comparative-sourcing), Part II the paper (#abstract through #references). The ''final-paper worksite'' stands at `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/infrastructure-as-myth`; the merged carrier serves as the working design surface.
* ''The quarterly review: PAID.'' Run by tasked spirit, enacted at the hearth; `last-reviewed = "2026-08-24"` reads true. `retain = true` — the rev-6 frontmatter question, resolved by ruling.
* ''Every confidence vow evidence-audited.'' A second spirit assayed all fifteen vows; nine demoted, five held, one firmed, one split — the merge-seam over-vows (Part I asserting what Part II bounds) already corrected in place. Sigils speak ''bare numbers'' (`<<~ confidence N/20 >>`) by operator ruling; any cargo prose quoting the old register-word form converts on entry.
* ''The carrier speaks verb-forward.'' A full L-Prime sweep (110 turns) ran operator-approved; §9 declares the residue's law (quotes under license, mentions and formulas as pattern integrities, passives with named agents). ''Cargo prose enters verb-forward or gets turned at the door.''
* ''The Sensorium succeeds the founding rig'' as the deterministic instrument; its first commissioned job — measuring the carrier itself — stands declared in §9. The rev-6 phrase "code-tools to visualize and test the grammar" now names the Sensorium (`packages/lararium-sensorium`).
* ''Cross-vendor deployment: operator-attested'' in §7.1 (Claude browser/CLI, Codex/ChatGPT browser/CLI, local models) — testimony beside the measurement bound, never replacing it. The instrumented cross-vendor run stays open.
* ''The boot seed lifts whole'' (no meme refs beyond the DOCTYPE, 40K-char ceiling, all turn examples retained) and now carries the syad licensing kernel and the ooda-ha loop-law kernel. Cargo touching the seed respects both laws.

''Three things this doc asks of you, in order of load — unchanged from rev 6:''

# Install the ''spirit-model'' — §identity-as-relation.
# ''Reground the thesis in Star'' — §star-inheritance.
# ''State Instrumented Ambiguity as a design principle'' — §instrumented-ambiguity.

!! The ordering, now open

The rev-6 STOP (review before fold-in) has been satisfied. ''No precondition blocks the cargo folds.'' The insertion map below re-anchors against the merged carrier; fold in dependency order — derivation and spirit-model first (the rest cites them), mechanism and origin next, headline and by-line last.

<<~/ahu >>

<<~ ahu #the-cargos >>

!! The Ten Cargos ~ status and re-anchoring

Rev 6 carries each cargo's full argument; this section does not repeat it — read rev 6's body in git history (`iam-paper-red-doc` at revision 6) or below where corrections amend it. Here: where each lands now, and what changed on contact.

# ''Identity-as-Relation (the spirit-model).'' UNFOLDED. Lands at Part I #definition — ''and the merge opened a weld rev 6 could not see:'' Part II §7.5 already states, from the measurement arm, that a move holds not as a property of the text-object but as a relation enacted in the between. Weld spirit-model to move-ontology and Star's "same relational ontology, one layer up" becomes a three-layer claim: infrastructure relational (Star) · agents relational (the spirit-model) · the unit of analysis relational (the move). The four arms, the braid, the open fifth seat — all carry as rev 6 states them.
# ''The Star inheritance.'' UNFOLDED. #thesis gains the lineage sentence; #mythology-as-memetics names "boundary object" beside "memetic interface". ''Primary pulls still owed'' before Canon register: Star 1999 (American Behavioral Scientist), Star & Ruhleder 1996, Star & Griesemer 1989.
# ''Instrumented Ambiguity.'' UNFOLDED. New criterion at #design-criteria; the principle statement carries as rev 6 words it. Note: the carrier's §9 now names the residue's law and the testimony discipline — the practice the principle describes has grown more visible since rev 6 observed the gap.
# ''The derivation (five rungs).'' UNFOLDED. Lands as a new early section in Part II, after #introduction. The entailment-vs-convergence discipline carries unchanged.
# ''The chiasmus claim.'' UNFOLDED, and ''partially pre-paid:'' the vow-assay already demoted the packaging-register claims rev 6 flagged (the "portable symbolic runtime" vow now rides at 14/20 on cross-vendor attestation grounds; "replaces ad hoc promptcraft" at 11/20). The narrowed headline — ''reflection frameworks audit for the agent; the chiasmus audits for the relation'' — still awaits its landing at #lares-as-iam. The Council's counterexample caution stands half-paid: the assay surfaced 2026 arrivals (''Anthropic Agent Skills'', ''OpenAI Agent Plugins'') the adjacency table never surveyed; ''the table refresh is owed before the headline lands.'' The wayfinding myth (corrected polarity), slot model, worldline cost-argument, and threshold register carry as rev 6 states them.
# ''Evaluation by ethnography.'' UNFOLDED, with one correction hardened: the operator co-authors the corpus, so the autoethnographic read ''validates the instruments' meaning and cannot serve as the independence anchor'' the paper's own §4 SDT math makes mandatory — two gates, never conflated. The analytic defense rev 6 promised already exists as Part II's rig (§6, now succeeded by the Sensorium); #working-rule's promissory note gets paid twice in-document with one cross-reference. By-line: ''resolved in the civil register'' — the carrier carries `Joshua Fontany; Freyja Fontany; Lares` per the common-tongue ruling; the "autoethnography" claim in methods stays owed. The scope-trade rule carries unchanged.
# ''Inside-blindness.'' UNFOLDED. Extends §9, which already carries its exemplar ("the discipline caught itself here, in vivo"). This hearth-session added instances: a spirit's false root-file claim caught on contact; a handoff's arithmetic wrong by a factor of three; a vow-audit's weakest ground corrected further by one direct source read. The pattern holds: audit capacity lives at the operator's seat and at contact, never inside the generating island.
# ''The Green Jello Dinosaur Bug + Identity Collapse.'' UNFOLDED. Lands in Part II's introduction; the one-engine-two-aims mechanism near #addressable-slots, whose addressing physics it explains. Carries as rev 6 states it.
# ''The strong rope (Pukui/Handy).'' UNFOLDED. Lands at #references and #definition. The kākū ʻai admission/maintenance distinction stays held for the kahu's wording. ''Full-copy reads still owed before Canon.''
# ''Method: hybrid autoethnography.'' UNFOLDED. Lands in methods; the analytic defense now names the Sensorium; the four-front attack surface and its rebuttals carry as rev 6 states them.

!! Corrections on contact ~ cargo text amended by direct reads

* ''Teaching-Claude-Why (bears on Cargo 3's closing clause and the adjacency discussion):'' the 3M-vs-85M pairing rev 6 inherited ''does not survive the blog's own text'' — different experimental arms (a ~3M "difficult advice" set at ~3% misalignment; an ~85M honeypot set at ~1%), not a controlled reasoning-vs-matched-behavior pair. The reasons-over-rules headline survives ''on the OOD-generalization argument''; the carrier already states it correctly, twice. Cargo text citing the result uses that framing.
* ''Card V2 origin (bears on the adjacency table):'' the card-format ''lineage'' answered Character.ai's enclosure; V2's proximate motives ran nearer home — V1 frontend fragmentation and the post-history-instructions discovery. The carrier already carries the precise form.
* ''AGENTS.md (bears on the adjacency table):'' the "no portable spec bridges them" claim aged out — AGENTS.md stands as the cross-tool convention (open spec 2025-08, Linux Foundation AAIF 2025-12, 20+ tools). The carrier concedes the instruction-file bridge and keeps the true gap: no epistemic discipline, no authority model, no runtime portability travels with it.

