<<~ ahu #cautions >>

!! Cautions ~ what survives, what resolved

''Surviving from rev 6, unchanged:'' name the teachers, name the adjacency, claim no authority · never cash biology as metaphysics · attribute the braid to the house at Synthesis · the Deep-Symbolic-Systems paper stays non-load-bearing (Chwe carries the point) · ''the fifth seat stays open'' — five hearth-rounds have now left it open deliberately.

''Resolved since rev 6:'' `retain` ruled true · the review stamped · the by-line register settled civil · the register-word sigil form retired · the two-document ambiguity dissolved by merge · the qa-rig succeeded by the Sensorium.

''Owed, in one place:'' primary pulls (Star ×3, Pukui/Handy full copies) before any Canon entry · the adjacency-table refresh (Agent Skills, Agent Plugins) before the headline lands · the hoike ingestion at the `findings/hoike/` seats · the Sensorium's commissioned self-measure · third-party turn-scoring (the true gold anchor) as named future work · the #implications shore-model rewrite (unfolded at the hearth, awaiting the operator's nod).

''One discipline for every fold:'' the carrier speaks verb-forward under a declared residue law, vows bare numbers seeded forward, and reports testimony as testimony. Cargo that arrives in another dialect gets turned at the door, never after it sinks in.

